**Keep the round held.** S6 identifies the registers correctly, but mischaracterizes the edits. M43 and M47 weaken **stored-field filtering**; M44 changes the validation operand and can **reject a write the fix accepts**. All three alter repair code introduced by `#518`.

I verified HEAD `7d7e055`, the uncommitted diff, and byte equality between the live source/probe and their round-four frozen copies. The t2 baseline differs by one comment only. The eight saved logs independently contain 67 scored rows and end with `LCABADVAL_DONE`. New results below are static arithmetic and source analysis; no builds or probes were run.

