There is an additional arithmetic trap: **`0x1fff00000` does not distinguish M44.** Its raw shifted field is `0x1fff`, and `0x1fff & 0x2000 == 0`. Enumerating all 13 legal fields with bit 32 added showed that `fff` alone remains accepted by M44.

