Thus neither prediction was secretly killed by an overlooked input.

The matrix needs a stronger definition of filtering than “one widened-mask example.” These are its eight cells; existing row names refer to the [frozen detector](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/lcabadval/killtable_20260910/t4/lca_badval_probe.REPAIRED67.asrun.py:393).

